      "body": "## Download It Here:\n\nhttps://web-annotator.com/\n\nhttps://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/web-annotator-highlightes/gfkkkknmlapddmdmlhnhggaapiblopad\n\n## Key Features:\n\n1. Mark Text: Select text and press Option + S to create a text note. If the selected text is inside a link, it will automatically save the link as well. If nothing is selected, it will save the entire page as a note.\n\n2. Mark Images: Right-click on any image and select \"Add Image Mark\" to save it as a note.\n\n3. Draw on Pages: Press Option + D to enter drawing mode, then press Command + S to save your drawing as a note.\n\n4. Quick Access: Press Option + W to quickly open the sidebar and manage all your notes.\n\n5. Smart Organization: The sidebar shows notes based on the current page path, domain, or all notes at once, helping you stay organized.\n\n6. Your Data is Yours: All your data is stored locally in your browser. Nothing is uploaded to any server, so your notes are completely secure. You can easily export your data for backup and import it back whenever you need to.\n\n7. Completely Free!\n\n## 图片 1:\n\n<img width=\"2496\" height=\"2062\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb68e091-9832-4686-8875-f2a59db6af9f\" />\n\n## 图片 2:\n\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"800\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93ee74f1-5256-4832-9091-7e5d6dcd6cd0\" />\n\n## 图片 3:\n\n<img width=\"2162\" height=\"1400\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1514209-21e1-4e87-b7be-da24861c5627\" />",
